   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">An analysis of the architecture of the EDI system is carried out with a focus on the implementation of a pilot project, with a description of all the necessary business processes</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analysis of system integration and architecture, with a focus on the implementation of a pilot project consisting of real-world examples of how to take advantage of the deployed EDI system infrastructure. Knowledge transfer is woven directly into the day-to-day work of the operator, with a Lead International Technical Expert leading the operator&apos;s work with the support of local experts, passing on the required guidance to the local team.</narrative>
    </description>
